Clouds yearn to dress her, flowers mirror her face;
Amid moonlit flowers and shadows in Revelry Hall, secret meetings unfold.

With her peerless beauty and regal grace, Zhou Qiang, known as the Peony of Revelry Hall, captivates all who behold her. Knowing her love for peonies, one admirer once raced from Luoyang to Kaifeng overnight, bringing her flowers still wet with morning dew. Yet, except for the grandest gatherings and festivals, the mistress of Revelry Hall never shows herself. Like a flower beyond the clouds, her beauty can only be admired from afar.
